(dd) all sums, dividends, shares, bonds, debentures, commercial papers, securities or any other payments received from a company or companies specified in clause
(b) of sub-section (5) of section 8;
(e) loans obtained by the Authority with the special or general sanction of the Government;
(f) foreign aid and loans obtained from the International Bank of Reconstruction and Development or otherwise, with the sanction and under the gaurantee of, and on such terms and conditions as may be approved by the Government; and
(g) all other sums received by the Authority.
